{"availability":"available","full":"giga-james/continual-outreach","name":"continual-outreach","description":"An agent distro for continual customer discovery: qualify prospects, personalize outreach, and learn from response feedback with exploration.","category":"Education","language":"Python","stars":2,"forks":0,"created":"2026-09-30T21:30:29Z","updated":"2026-10-03T01:36:33Z","branch":"main","homepage":"","topics":[],"demo":null,"color":"#193546","ink":"#a6d6e8","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-03T09:36:58.563Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-03T09:36:58.563Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-03T09:36:58.563Z","lastDemoCheckedAt":"2026-10-03T09:36:58.563Z","discoveredVia":[],"metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-03T09:36:58.563Z","stars":2,"forks":0}],"technologies":["Python"],"overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["Continual Outreach is an agent distro for customer discovery and outreach. Tell it your product idea and who you want to learn from. It helps sharpen your ideal customer profile, researches people on the internet, personalizes outreach, tracks responses, and uses what it learns to improve the next batch.","An agent distro is a portable package that gives a general-purpose AI agent a specialized job: instructions define how it works, skills handle particular tasks, scripts make repeated operations reliable, and state conventions let it resume later.","This repository is that package. Open Codex, Claude Code or another harness in it—or load its instructions from your existing workspace—and that agent follows the continual-outreach workflow. Your chosen agent supplies the model, browser access and connected tools. This repo supplies the outreach expertise, campaign tracking, scheduling helpers and feedback loop. Private campaign data stays separate from the reusable package."],"features":["The agent handles browser startup. It discovers and starts the computer-use tools","in its environment. If access or login is missing, it asks for that specific step and continues any available read-only research. Cloning the repo does not install a browser integration.","Channel support is explicit. The included send guard supports LinkedIn profile","identity. Other channels can be researched and drafted, but need a tested identity adapter before automated sending.","Pacing is not platform permission. LinkedIn prohibits third-party automated"],"sourceUrl":"https://github.com/giga-james/continual-outreach/blob/main/README.md","fingerprint":"5804ff026d4435afe0693c78f901cebab8dc67cdf74e92aa00aa6bdca1708668","extractedAt":"2026-10-03T09:36:58.563Z"},"overviewCheckedAt":"2026-10-03T09:36:58.563Z","projectInsights":{"version":1,"whatItDoes":{"text":"Continual Outreach is an agent distro for customer discovery and outreach. Tell it your product idea and who you want to learn from. It helps sharpen your ideal customer profile, researches people on the internet, personalizes outreach, tracks responses, and uses what it learns to improve the next batch.","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/giga-james/continual-outreach/blob/main/README.md"},"audience":[],"requirements":[{"kind":"account","status":"required","text":"If access or login is missing, it asks for that specific step and continues any available read-only research.","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/giga-james/continual-outreach/blob/main/README.md"},{"kind":"account","status":"required","text":"When campaigns share a sender account, account-wide limits and duplicate checks still need reconciliation across campaigns.","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/giga-james/continual-outreach/blob/main/README.md"}],"fingerprint":"5804ff026d4435afe0693c78f901cebab8dc67cdf74e92aa00aa6bdca1708668","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/giga-james/continual-outreach/blob/main/README.md","checkedAt":"2026-10-03T09:36:58.563Z"},"overviewRepoUpdated":"2026-10-03T01:36:33Z","readmeSnapshot":{"version":1,"status":"saved","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/giga-james/continual-outreach/blob/main/README.md","checkedAt":"2026-10-03T09:36: